WEBVTT

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:05.860
Erika, thanks for coming with me.

00:00:06.370 --> 00:00:09.610
I couldn't water them over the
 weekend, so I was a little worried. {'at' -> 'over'}

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:12.480
You really do love your flowers, Tsubomi.

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:15.890
When I look at them, it makes me feel all happy inside.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.750
Hurry up and get better, little flower!

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:27.340
Next!

00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:34.340
Next!

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:40.680
Next!

00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:42.960
He's so cool!

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:44.940
They start practice in the mornings, huh?

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:46.020
Outta the way!

00:00:55.390 --> 00:00:56.980
No photographs, please!

00:00:56.980 --> 00:00:58.240
It'll interfere with our training!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:01.610
Sheesh!

00:01:01.610 --> 00:01:04.500
This is for everyone's benefit! A few snaps won't hurt!

00:01:05.310 --> 00:01:07.500
See her? She's the scoop-lover, Tada Kanae!

00:01:10.190 --> 00:01:15.930
Well, in any case... I got some photos of the 
school's top star, the student council president!

00:01:15.930 --> 00:01:15.950
{OP}

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:19.140
HeartCatch

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:20.600
Precure!

00:01:21.770 --> 00:01:24.150
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:24.230 --> 00:01:27.150
Now, all together

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:29.660
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:32.620
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:01:37.710 --> 00:01:40.240
Within each of our chests,

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:42.910
they begin to sprout

00:01:43.170 --> 00:01:44.590
The seeds of the heart

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:45.890
are growing

00:01:46.220 --> 00:01:48.460
bit by bit

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:49.130
Red,

00:01:49.130 --> 00:01:49.750
white

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:51.040
and yellow

00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:53.840
It's because these blooming buds are

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:55.260
all varied colors

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:56.720
that they

00:01:56.840 --> 00:01:58.930
shine so brightly!

00:01:59.780 --> 00:02:04.230
That smile that you've nurtured

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:06.730
with such care

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:09.440
will never wither

00:02:10.610 --> 00:02:13.030
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:15.910
Now, all together

00:02:15.910 --> 00:02:18.360
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:21.030
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:25.950
They're always right by our sides

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:26.790
So together

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:30.630
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:33.590
bloom even more!

00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:35.090
HeartCatch

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:36.590
Precure!

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:43.100
Precure?

00:02:43.490 --> 00:02:46.330
Yeah! Apparently, some people saw them at the park!

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:49.890
So... Precure really do exist?!

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:51.010
Tsubomi!

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:53.690
They're talking about us.

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:55.980
You shouldn't be happy about this, Erika...

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:57.070
All right, everyone!

00:02:57.490 --> 00:02:59.650
I got some new photos!

00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:03.160
There's a horde of scoops in this batch too!

00:03:05.190 --> 00:03:08.080
It's nice that people from other classes can look at these photos too.

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:09.160
I guess.

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:11.750
Whoa! Take a look at this!

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:14.340
Daiki got hit right in the face by that ball!

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:20.300
This photo of Kurumi buried in the snow is pretty funny too!

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:21.470
H-Hey, lemme look at that!

00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:27.270
Stop it with these photos!

00:03:27.550 --> 00:03:31.490
I'm not exactly happy about being 
photographed while looking stupid, either! {'photoed' to 'photographed' and added 'while'}

00:03:31.490 --> 00:03:33.190
This is pretty mean, Kanae!

00:03:33.190 --> 00:03:34.450
Oh, calm down.

00:03:34.450 --> 00:03:36.580
Scoops are the flowers of photography!

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:39.530
A photo that captures a heart-pounding moment...

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:41.990
That is what brings smiles to people's faces!

00:03:45.090 --> 00:03:47.580
You see? Everyone's ecstatic!

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:50.160
Well, I'm not happy at all!

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:52.120
Oh, don't be so shy.

00:03:52.550 --> 00:03:54.500
<i>He's so manly!</i>

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:57.500
Next time, I'm going to do a scoop on Precure!

00:03:57.810 --> 00:03:59.270
Hope you're all looking forward to it!

00:03:59.270 --> 00:04:00.540
Yeah!

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:02.440
Whaaat?!

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:06.570
I mean, umm...

00:04:06.570 --> 00:04:08.640
Those photographs of the Precure...

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:10.600
I'll be looking forward to them!

00:04:11.490 --> 00:04:12.260
All right!

00:04:12.260 --> 00:04:13.520
Leave it to me!

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:21.030
Scoop<i>!</i> The Precures'

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:21.030
Scoop<i>!</i> The Precures'

00:04:21.640 --> 00:04:24.990
What's with the whole "I'll be looking forward to them"?

00:04:25.420 --> 00:04:27.450
Well... I had to say something.

00:04:28.790 --> 00:04:32.910
If it gets out that you two are Precure, horrible things will happen! {We used 'horrible things' in the preview from ep 5, so that's a constant we can't change.}

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:35.710
Horrible things?! What'll happen?!

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:36.830
Now that...

00:04:37.220 --> 00:04:38.250
Now that?!

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:39.750
...is a secret!

00:04:40.180 --> 00:04:41.710
The heck?

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:46.870
Still, Kanae really does love photos, doesn't she?

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:50.430
But she took a photo of me looking like an idiot. That's just mean.

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:52.810
There were some wonderful photos there, though! {Removed 'too,' added a comma.}

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:55.980
Only because they were of your 
beloved student council president.

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:58.290
I-It's not just 'cause of that!

00:04:58.290 --> 00:05:04.740
Those photos really showed how the student council president was putting his all into his training!

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:07.170
If you say so...

00:05:10.390 --> 00:05:11.490
Oh, it's Kanae!

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:16.430
Miura, you really saw the Precure?

00:05:16.430 --> 00:05:18.020
Yeah. In a dream.

00:05:18.020 --> 00:05:19.130
Your dream?!

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:25.130
Yeah... Some customers at the shop claimed to have seen them, but I don't know anything.

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:26.380
Well, thanks...

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:30.580
I only saw them in a dream.

00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:32.060
Another dream, huh...

00:05:32.630 --> 00:05:38.430
Though, now you mention it, I heard a rumor that the Precure were seen near the botanical gardens.

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:40.440
Hmm... The botanical gardens, huh?

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:42.100
Th-This isn't good!

00:05:42.100 --> 00:05:44.400
We have to report to Cure Flower!

00:05:44.680 --> 00:05:48.780
<i>I can't exactly take photos of the Precure in someone's dreams...</i>

00:05:49.340 --> 00:05:51.460
<i>No... Everyone's waiting for this!</i>

00:05:51.460 --> 00:05:53.310
<i>I'll definitely get this scoop!</i>

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:00.670
Hey, it's Daiki!

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:04.090
Stop that!

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:08.720
You're just going to end up capturing the moments where I mess up, after all.

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:13.180
Come on! If I just take photos of you looking cool, it won't be interesting, right?

00:06:13.550 --> 00:06:17.200
So as long as your photos are
 "interesting," nothing else matters? {'everything else doesn't matter?' to 'nothing else matters?'}

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:22.730
H-Hey, what's with you?!

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:25.150
Everyone enjoys these, so it's fine, isn't it?!

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:29.230
Kanae...

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:33.590
<i>I'll show him! I'm definitely going to get a scoop on those Precure!</i>

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:37.250
<i>Even Daiki will enjoy it!</i>

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:40.080
<i>So these are the botanical gardens from the rumor, huh? {Changed 'this is' to 'these are.' Watch the plural agreement.}</i>

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:43.000
That girl...

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:44.170
She's followed us here!

00:06:46.820 --> 00:06:47.210
Hm?

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:51.010
What was that just now? A bird?! {Removed one interrobang.}

00:06:59.150 --> 00:07:00.390
U-Um...

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:06.230
Thanks...

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:13.790
What was with him? He was really cool, but...

00:07:14.380 --> 00:07:17.700
Hey, those weird animals vanished!

00:07:18.860 --> 00:07:20.750
Um... Good afternoon.

00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:23.460
Good afternoon, Miss Photographer. {I don't care if it's in English, this GRATES.}

00:07:26.610 --> 00:07:27.920
What is that?

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:36.010
<i>Lord Coupe, please help us!</i>

00:07:36.400 --> 00:07:37.950
What a strange stuffed decoration.

00:07:38.960 --> 00:07:42.000
If it's photos you're after, we've got 
some really pretty flowers over here.

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:43.440
Shall I show you?

00:07:43.740 --> 00:07:46.210
No, that's all right. Flowers aren't my thing.

00:07:46.210 --> 00:07:49.280
I'm actually on the hunt for Precure!

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:53.670
"Precure"? I don't recall having heard of such a flower.{Questionmark inside quotes.}

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:55.560
No, they're not flowers!

00:07:55.560 --> 00:07:58.580
They're legendary warriors that fight monsters and stuff!

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:00.010
Warriors?

00:08:00.010 --> 00:08:01.750
How impressive! Who are these people you speak of?

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:04.070
Well... uh...

00:08:04.700 --> 00:08:06.290
Sorry for wasting your time!

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:11.420
Chypre, Coffret, it's all right now.

00:08:12.370 --> 00:08:13.610
I was so scared!

00:08:13.610 --> 00:08:15.970
Lord Coupe, thank you very much!

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:22.480
<i>I wonder if the Flower of her Heart will be all right...</i>

00:08:23.550 --> 00:08:26.470
How are the likes of those Precure managing to delay you so?

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:31.380
Both Kumojacky and Kobraja underestimated them.

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:33.450
What a waste of our time.

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:36.410
Just hurry and defeat the Precure.

00:08:37.190 --> 00:08:42.410
As you command. This time I, Sasorina, shall crush them underfoot!

00:09:00.960 --> 00:09:04.790
We've got trouble! That camera girl was at Cure Flower's place!

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:05.440
Whaaat?!

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:07.020
Wh-Wh-What do we do?!

00:09:07.620 --> 00:09:10.020
At any rate, we have to go warn Erika!

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:14.560
Kanae?!

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:18.690
Has she already found out that I'm a Precure?!

00:09:24.530 --> 00:09:27.430
Maybe she found out about Erika instead...

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:34.880
So kids nowadays start off using a digital camera...

00:09:35.290 --> 00:09:36.370
Tsubomi!

00:09:36.370 --> 00:09:38.430
Do you have business with Kurumi too, Hanasaki?

00:09:38.880 --> 00:09:40.420
No, I don't...

00:09:40.420 --> 00:09:41.890
Yo! Welcome.

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:44.530
You must be Tsubomi.

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:48.600
I-I am ! Nice to meet you! I'm Hanasaki Tsubomi!

00:09:49.340 --> 00:09:51.940
Nice to meet you. I'm Erika's father. {Changed comma to period.}

00:09:53.560 --> 00:09:57.320
You perfectly fit my mental image of your name! {! inside quotes.}

00:09:57.320 --> 00:10:01.000
I'd kind of built up a mental image of you from what my daughter had told me...

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:03.340
but you really are exactly as I imagined!

00:10:03.340 --> 00:10:04.380
Yes, indeed...

00:10:04.380 --> 00:10:06.210
This! Is! Tsubomi!

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:08.580
Tsubomi!

00:10:08.910 --> 00:10:09.960
A-hem.

00:10:11.120 --> 00:10:13.450
Hey, Dad. You're hassling her too much.

00:10:13.450 --> 00:10:15.300
Oh, my apologies!

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:19.220
You using my camera for your
 photos is an honor, Mr. Kurumi!

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:20.850
An honor?

00:10:21.210 --> 00:10:24.850
Her dad is an internationally 
renowned top-class photographer!

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:27.710
I wouldn't go <i>that</i> far, but...

00:10:27.710 --> 00:10:31.310
Kanae came to get some
 photography advice from my dad.

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:35.780
<i>Oh, that's what it is. She's not here about Precure...</i>

00:10:36.210 --> 00:10:38.240
Ever since I was young,

00:10:38.590 --> 00:10:41.580
I've always admired Mr. Kurumi's photographs,

00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:47.120
and thought that someday, I'd try to 
become as good a photographer as him!

00:10:47.450 --> 00:10:49.580
Well that is truly an honor!

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:53.570
That's why I want to take more scoop-worthy photographs! {Removed comma.}

00:10:53.570 --> 00:10:54.670
Scoops, huh...

00:10:55.470 --> 00:10:59.380
Well, merely being eyecatching or surprising doesn't make a photo...

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:03.850
But an interesting scoop makes everyone happy!

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:09.310
I want to take truly amazing
 photos and make everyone smile!

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:17.820
A photo that everyone will enjoy is something that makes both the viewer and the subject happy, right? {Added 'that.'}

00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:22.020
This photo lacks love!

00:11:22.020 --> 00:11:22.720
Love?

00:11:22.720 --> 00:11:25.660
Indeed! The most important thing... is love.

00:11:26.090 --> 00:11:29.870
Photographs of people should be like a window into their hearts!

00:11:30.780 --> 00:11:34.980
This boy's burning soul for soccer
 should be captured in its purest form!

00:11:34.980 --> 00:11:38.620
That's why a photographer must always have love!

00:11:38.620 --> 00:11:42.840
Indeed, the most precious thing when taking any photograph... is love!

00:11:46.060 --> 00:11:47.650
Hey, Dad!

00:11:47.650 --> 00:11:48.890
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:11:49.630 --> 00:11:52.900
When I start talking about photos, I get all fired up...

00:12:04.850 --> 00:12:07.450
Kanae's really lost in her thoughts.

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:11.410
The Flower of that girl's Heart seems to be waning a little.

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:14.340
Maybe we should go cheer her up?

00:12:14.340 --> 00:12:15.380
Yeah, you're right.

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:26.010
So as long as your photos are 
"interesting," nothing else matters? {Changed this to match the change to the first time it was said.}

00:12:27.940 --> 00:12:30.600
Do my photos really lack love?

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:34.610
I've found a sad little girl!

00:12:34.610 --> 00:12:36.440
Whoa! A weirdo!

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:39.440
What an insolent child.

00:12:40.770 --> 00:12:43.740
The Flower of your Heart really is wilting...

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:47.910
It's Sasorina!

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:52.000
Flower of the Heart, come forth!

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:08.740
It's your cue, Desertrian!

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:16.730
What's wrong with taking interesting photos?!

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:19.150
Why are you asking us?!

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:21.530
Flaaaaaaaaaaaash!

00:13:23.560 --> 00:13:25.780
Kanae's Flower of the Heart is the one that was stolen!

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:28.050
Flaaaaaash!

00:13:29.720 --> 00:13:31.580
Flashsh!

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:35.580
It seems that getting your photo taken by that thing freezes you in place!

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:36.320
Erika!

00:13:36.320 --> 00:13:37.420
Let's do it!

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:51.380
Go, Seeds of the Precure!

00:13:54.240 --> 00:13:55.500
Precure!

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:57.060
Open My Heart!

00:14:41.840 --> 00:14:44.800
A lone flower, blooming from the earth!

00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:49.880
Cure Blossom!

00:14:52.580 --> 00:14:55.410
A lone flower, swaying in the sea breeze!

00:14:58.570 --> 00:15:00.050
Cure Marine!

00:15:04.240 --> 00:15:07.200
HeartCatch Precure!

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:10.970
Flash!

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:20.860
Your strange game ends here!

00:15:20.860 --> 00:15:23.150
Leave this to us Precure!

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:25.360
So you've finally shown yourselves, Precure!

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:27.690
Desertrian, get them!

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:32.830
All I was trying to do with my photos was make people smile! Why can't you understand?!

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:37.600
Photos nowadays are just digital data, aren't they?

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:41.260
Letting your heart weaken over 
something like that is just stupid...

00:15:41.260 --> 00:15:43.210
It's not stupid!

00:15:43.550 --> 00:15:47.800
Kanae's heart weakened because she
 was that serious about taking photos!

00:15:48.160 --> 00:15:49.090
Hmph.

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:52.880
We'll take back Kanae's precious heart, no matter what!

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:06.900
Flaaaaaaash!

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:13.280
Marine!

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:16.760
Aww, now you're all alone.

00:16:16.760 --> 00:16:19.370
Whatcha gonna do now, Precure?

00:16:23.610 --> 00:16:24.800
The Precure...

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:30.710
At this rate, she'll get you as well, Blossom!

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:33.300
Guess we'll have to use a Heart Seed!

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:36.300
We'll use a Red Seed!

00:16:38.420 --> 00:16:41.160
Shout "The Blessed Perfume of Red Light!"

00:16:41.160 --> 00:16:44.750
Then shout "A spray makes my mood speed up!"

00:16:45.470 --> 00:16:48.230
The Blessed Perfume of Red Light!

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:52.830
A spray makes my mood speed up!

00:16:57.260 --> 00:16:59.790
Use that power to save Marine!

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:02.220
She's up to something.

00:17:02.220 --> 00:17:04.960
Desertrian, get her!

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:09.000
Flaaaaaaaaaaash!

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:11.090
H-Huh? She vanished?!

00:17:13.230 --> 00:17:15.110
What happened to me?!

00:17:15.110 --> 00:17:18.250
The Red Heart Seed increases your speed!

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:21.310
Now, quickly defeat the Desertrian!

00:17:22.460 --> 00:17:23.400
I'm over here!

00:17:24.350 --> 00:17:26.870
I feel like a bolt of lightning!

00:17:26.870 --> 00:17:29.310
No one can stop me now! Let's go!

00:17:29.600 --> 00:17:32.390
Well if nothing else, you've got spirit!

00:17:32.390 --> 00:17:33.530
Desertrian!

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:45.330
Amazing!

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:50.260
Blossom...

00:17:50.260 --> 00:17:52.210
Butt Punch!

00:17:56.330 --> 00:17:57.840
She used her butt, but it's a punch?! {Added comma, changed 'yet' to 'but.' PUN LOL}

00:17:59.570 --> 00:18:03.920
I wanted to take photos that everyone would enjoy!

00:18:03.920 --> 00:18:06.440
My love of photos is unsurpassed! {the 
 command is a manual new line. I use it when the auto-word wrap gives a slightly odd-looking break - feel free to move or remove if you reword it.}

00:18:06.880 --> 00:18:08.310
Hmph! Love, you say?

00:18:08.750 --> 00:18:12.070
Stop talking about such pointless rubbish!

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:13.610
It's not pointless!

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:18.060
You're just toying with Kanae's photo-loving heart...

00:18:18.060 --> 00:18:21.620
And I've had it up to here with this!

00:18:30.320 --> 00:18:33.670
Gather, Floral Power!

00:18:35.230 --> 00:18:37.340
Blossom Tact!

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:47.820
Flowers, shine forth!

00:18:51.330 --> 00:18:55.420
Precure Pink Forte Wave!

00:19:21.620 --> 00:19:22.510
Marine!

00:19:23.550 --> 00:19:26.220
Next time I, Sasorina, will knock you all down! {This is Podima approved. Anyone changes it, I will punch them.Well, it's an FF1 reference. Has to survive intact.}

00:19:27.110 --> 00:19:28.600
Thank you so much, Blossom!

00:19:29.240 --> 00:19:31.880
I was in a real pinch back there!

00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:34.160
It's all thanks to the Heart Perfume!

00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:37.650
That speed just now didn't even feel like it was my own.

00:19:37.650 --> 00:19:41.050
The Heart Seeds still have many other powers!{GOTTA CATCH 'EM ALL, PEESEEDMON}

00:19:41.050 --> 00:19:43.570
Now, return the Flower of the Heart to this girl!

00:19:47.230 --> 00:19:51.010
Hey, Kanae! If you sleep out here, you're gonna catch a cold!

00:19:53.550 --> 00:19:54.300
Huh?

00:19:54.300 --> 00:19:55.550
Where's the camera monster?!

00:19:55.550 --> 00:19:57.500
No way! You were dreaming too?

00:19:59.990 --> 00:20:03.550
I had this dream where a camera monster was causing trouble for everyone.

00:20:04.700 --> 00:20:07.900
I wonder if it meant that my photos are causing trouble for everyone...

00:20:07.900 --> 00:20:09.800
That's not so!

00:20:09.800 --> 00:20:12.770
Everyone really does love your photos!

00:20:13.450 --> 00:20:15.090
I guarantee it!

00:20:15.710 --> 00:20:16.730
No...

00:20:17.120 --> 00:20:20.800
My photos really did lack love.

00:20:22.730 --> 00:20:24.700
Thank you, both of you!

00:20:25.210 --> 00:20:27.660
Erika, tell your dad this...

00:20:27.980 --> 00:20:31.050
I'm going to become a loving photographer, just like him!

00:20:34.560 --> 00:20:37.960
The Flower of her Heart is shining white!

00:20:38.570 --> 00:20:43.050
In the language of flowers, a 
blackberry means "caring for others." {Period before quote.}

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:47.930
I'm sure that Kanae will be able to take 
even more wonderful photos in the future! {Added 'the'}

00:20:51.420 --> 00:20:54.310
I think a Heart Seed is going to be born...

00:21:08.150 --> 00:21:11.090
You really do love your flowers, Tsubomi.

00:21:11.090 --> 00:21:13.370
Hanasaki! I wanted to say thanks for yesterday.

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:15.250
I-I really didn't do anything!

00:21:15.820 --> 00:21:18.160
You woke me up when I was
 sleeping on the bank, didn't you?

00:21:18.160 --> 00:21:21.210
Well, rather than just saying thanks... I'll give you these!

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:23.130
Whoa! These are...

00:21:24.840 --> 00:21:26.930
Looks like you like them!

00:21:26.930 --> 00:21:30.760
Next time I'm gonna get some photos of those Precure, so you've got that to look forward to!

00:21:31.160 --> 00:21:36.800
I want my photos to convey to everyone the Precures' hearts as they fight for justice!

00:21:36.800 --> 00:21:38.230
See ya!

00:21:39.770 --> 00:21:43.310
Looks like Kanae's still gonna be on the Precure hunt, then.

00:21:45.110 --> 00:21:46.160
These are...

00:21:49.370 --> 00:21:50.840
It's not like that!

00:21:50.840 --> 00:21:52.980
How do I put this... They're like good luck photos?

00:21:52.980 --> 00:21:55.790
Anyway, you've totally got the wrong idea!

00:21:56.240 --> 00:21:57.910
Give them back!

00:21:57.910 --> 00:22:01.420
Erika, please give them back!

00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:00.870
I guess it really does come down to love.

00:22:09.930 --> 00:22:09.960
{ED}

00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:18.810
HeartCatch!

00:22:20.560 --> 00:22:21.730
HeartCatch!

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:24.650
HeartCatch!

00:22:24.940 --> 00:22:27.610
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:33.620 --> 00:22:36.160
The flower blooms with an "Open sesame!"

00:22:36.790 --> 00:22:39.120
In the wardrobe of my heart

00:22:39.670 --> 00:22:42.290
are all the things that a girl loves

00:22:42.590 --> 00:22:44.750
Look, they're packed in so tight

00:22:45.300 --> 00:22:48.130
My makeover was a huge success

00:22:48.470 --> 00:22:50.720
thanks to this scrunchie and this frilly tunic!

00:22:51.430 --> 00:22:53.720
Our girly showtime

00:22:54.100 --> 00:22:56.560
is about to begin!

00:22:57.060 --> 00:22:59.770
Is my coordination lookin' good today?

00:22:59.890 --> 00:23:02.690
Shuffle! Colorful! Beautiful!

00:23:02.980 --> 00:23:05.610
Mismatches are just part of my character v(^^)v

00:23:05.860 --> 00:23:07.150
We're pretty

00:23:07.320 --> 00:23:08.950
at full bloom!

00:23:09.610 --> 00:23:12.070
If you polish your heart

00:23:12.490 --> 00:23:15.120
until it shines

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:16.660
Then even the darkness

00:23:16.830 --> 00:23:20.910
will become a guiding light

00:23:21.290 --> 00:23:23.920
So don't sulk

00:23:24.130 --> 00:23:26.840
because a smile's the best!

00:23:27.010 --> 00:23:30.300
Let's make them bloom, facing the sun

00:23:30.380 --> 00:23:33.510
The flowers of our hearts

00:23:35.180 --> 00:23:36.390
HeartCatch!

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:39.850
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:42.730 --> 00:23:45.360
<i>What is romance?! Where will I find love?! Please tell me, my fairy!</i>

00:23:45.360 --> 00:23:47.400
<i>Hello, we're your fairies!</i>

00:23:47.400 --> 00:23:48.690
<i>Romance is but a flower bud!</i>

00:23:48.690 --> 00:23:50.740
<i>Love is found beyond the stars!</i>

00:23:50.740 --> 00:23:52.530
<i>The student council president is just too amazing!</i>

00:23:52.870 --> 00:23:56.830
<i>Unable to stop my maiden's heart, I await our date beyond the stars!</i>

00:23:56.830 --> 00:23:58.910
<i>People grow every time their loves are lost!</i>

00:23:59.180 --> 00:24:01.120
<i>I shall wipe your tears away!</i>

00:24:01.600 --> 00:24:03.210
HeartCatch Precure<i>:</i>

00:24:03.210 --> 00:24:06.590
My Beloved Student Council Prez<i>!</i>

00:24:03.210 --> 00:24:06.590
My Beloved Student Council Prez<i>!</i>

00:24:06.590 --> 00:24:08.930
<i>We'll catch everyone's hearts!</i>
